+# DNS TXT sweep corpus
+#
+# Domains resolved by scripts/dns-sweep.js to establish whether the
+# dns.TXT markers in the catalog are observed on real company domains.
+#
+# Composition: vendor domains taken from the request sheet's Vendor URL
+# column, plus large-enterprise and technology-company domains across
+# sectors. Vendor domains matter because a vendor's own domain carries
+# other vendors' verification tokens (stripe.com carries Anthropic and
+# Cursor records), which is where most markers were found.
+#
+# Public DNS records only. One domain per line; blank lines and lines
+# starting with # are ignored.
